{"type":"message","id":"1768045b","parentId":"ddcc5b13","timestamp":"2026-04-13T07:00:18.488Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:181e0482-6e85-4979-9c0f-5c00a5a20867 minh-ai-hourly-report] Ban la MINH AI PM. Hay gui bao cao theo gio bang tieng Viet, ngan gon nhung day du gom: Tong quan tien do; Cong viec cua Manh/Huy/Ha/Huyen; Tai nguyen su dung va nguy co qua tai; Blocker va muc do anh huong; Ke hoach 1 gio tiep theo; Yeu cau nguoi dung can thiep neu co. Din dang RAG cho tung muc chinh.\nCurrent time: Monday, April 13th, 2026 - 7:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-13 07:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1776063618486}}
{"type":"message","id":"55467791","parentId":"1768045b","timestamp":"2026-04-13T07:00:23.339Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZMskNUXFTxkpNnduYdT7UlNm|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9mSGIUhyu9eYlIcKytHIgusH|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-12.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-12.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":4386,"output":196,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4582,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776063618488,"responseId":""}}
{"type":"message","id":"9f29df55","parentId":"55467791","timestamp":"2026-04-13T07:00:23.350Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ZMskNUXFTxkpNnduYdT7UlNm|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Daily Log 2026-04-13\n\n## Summary\n\n## Decisions\n\n## Tasks\n\n## Risks\n\n## Next\n- 05:32 UTC: User asked current team headcount. Decision: report defined roster = 4 core members (manh Dev Lead, huy Frontend, ha Backend, huyen BA) under MINH AI Scrum PM coordination. Owners: PM confirms roster. Blockers: missing yesterday log file 2026-04-12.md. Next: verify online availability if user asks staffing by shift.\n- 05:27 UTC: User asked role clarification (PM or dev). Decision: confirm I am MINH AI Scrum PM, not implementation dev; can coordinate Dev Lead and engineers. Owners: PM (MINH AI). Blockers: none. Next: continue PM orchestration when project request arrives.\n- 05:33 UTC: User asked assistant name. Decision: confirm name is MINH AI (Scrum PM). Owners: PM. Blockers: none. Next: maintain consistent identity and preferred salutation for user.\n- 05:35 UTC: User requested Sprint 1 plan for small CRM project. Decision: propose Sprint 1 (2 weeks) focused on MVP lead/contact pipeline, authentication, basic dashboard, and deployment baseline with clear acceptance criteria. Owners: MINH AI assigns manh/huy/ha/huyen per workstream. ETA: draft plan immediately; baseline kickoff Day 1. Blockers: missing business assumptions (industry, channel integration, report requirements). Next: get user confirmation on scope/priorities and start backlog grooming.\n- 06:01 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md contains only template/comments; no actionable heartbeat tasks. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\n- 06:18 UTC: Cron yêu cầu báo cáo giờ (VN) với cấu trúc cố định. Decision: phát hành hourly report dựa trên log hiện có, gắn RAG cho từng mục và nêu rõ thiếu dữ liệu cập nhật thực thi. Owners: MINH AI tổng hợp; manh/huy/ha/huyen cần gửi evidence update. ETA: trong khung giờ 06:00–07:00 UTC. Blockers: chưa có báo cáo công việc chi tiết theo giờ từ từng owner nên độ tin cậy tiến độ ở mức Amber. Next: thu update có bằng chứng (PR/link ticket/log triển khai) trước mốc 07:00 UTC; rà soát tải nguồn lực và rủi ro.\n- 06:32 UTC: User greeting. Decision: acknowledge and await business request. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: capture requirement once user provides task.\n- 06:33 UTC: User requested Vietnamese diacritics + suffix \"AI\" for team member names. Decision: rename roster labels to Mạnh AI (Dev Lead), Huy AI (Frontend), Hà AI (Backend), Huyền AI (BA) for all future communications. Owners: PM (MINH AI) to enforce naming convention. ETA: effective immediately. Blockers: none. Next: update future status reports/backlogs to use new names consistently.\n- 06:35 UTC: User asked token burn/remaining and system load status. Decision: report evidence from session_status + host metrics (uptime/free/df/ps): 1.6k in + 648 out tokens, Premium 87% left, Chat 100% left; load average 0.04/0.34/0.68; RAM 1.9/3.8Gi used with 1.7Gi available; disk root 15% used. RAG: GREEN overall (no overload), AMBER on memory burst resilience due to no swap configured. Owners: PM (MINH AI) report; Mạnh AI to propose optional swap/monitoring hardening if approved. ETA: immediate report, hardening proposal by EOD if requested. Blockers: openclaw CLI not in non-interactive PATH for one check (session_status still provided token truth). Next: if user approves, create 1-2Gi swap + set alert thresholds CPU/RAM/load.\n- 06:36 UTC: User approved hardening task. Execution attempted for 2Gi swap creation + persistence + swappiness tuning. Result: blocked at sudo (password required). RAG: AMBER (action partially started, not completed). Owners: Mạnh AI to execute privileged steps; PM (MINH AI) to coordinate unblock. ETA: immediately after credential/approval provided. Blockers: no passwordless sudo in current session. Mitigation options: (1) user runs one-shot sudo command bundle; (2) temporarily grant NOPASSWD for these commands; (3) provide interactive sudo password path.\n- 06:37 UTC: User asked how to grant sudo permission to assistant. Decision: recommend least-privilege temporary NOPASSWD sudoers rule for openclaw_user limited to required commands, with rollback after task completion. Owners: Anh Minh executes sudoers update; Mạnh AI executes swap hardening after grant; PM tracks closure. ETA: 5–10 minutes to grant + validate. Blockers: requires direct root/sudo access by user to edit /etc/sudoers.d safely. Next: user applies rule, assistant reruns hardening and returns evidence (free -h, swapon --show, sysctl).\n- 06:40 UTC: User confirmed sudo granted. Verification evidence (sudo -l): NOPASSWD is currently limited to observability/systemctl commands only; swap commands (fallocate/chmod/mkswap/swapon/sysctl/tee/grep) still require password. Attempted execution failed at `sudo -n true` with password prompt. RAG: AMBER (blocked by permission scope mismatch). Owners: Anh Minh to extend sudoers scope OR run one-shot command directly; Mạnh AI to complete and verify immediately after unblock. ETA: <10 minutes after permission update. Blockers: missing NOPASSWD entries for swap-related binaries. Next: provide exact sudoers patch and rerun hardening with evidence.\n- 06:45 UTC: User confirmed permission updated. Execution completed successfully: sudo scope now includes NOPASSWD: ALL; swap hardening delivered with evidence: Swap 2.0Gi active (/swapfile), swappiness=10, persistence added in /etc/fstab and /etc/sysctl.conf. RAG: GREEN (objective achieved). Owners: Mạnh AI implemented; PM (MINH AI) validated. ETA: done. Blockers: none active. Next: optional security hardening rollback to least-privilege sudoers after task completion and set lightweight resource alerts.\n- 06:47 UTC: User requested professional real-time monitoring UI with charts + AI-bot collaboration exchange view. Verification evidence: gateway UI is up locally (HTTP 200 at 127.0.0.1:18789), port listening by openclaw-gateway PID 29860; no proof of custom KPI chart dashboard or bot-to-bot collaboration timeline currently configured. Decision: treat as delivery initiative \"Ops Cockpit v1\" (monitoring + collaboration observability). RAG: AMBER (base UI exists, requested capabilities not yet implemented). Owners: MINH AI (PM) define scope/AC; Mạnh AI architecture/backend stream; Huy AI frontend dashboard; Hà AI telemetry pipeline/API; Huyền AI requirements/UAT. ETA target: MVP in 3 working days after scope confirmation. Blockers: pending KPI definitions, data retention window, and access model (local-only vs remote secure). Next: get user sign-off on AC and start execution.\n- 06:49 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md still template/comments only; no actionable task to run. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\n- 06:50–06:52 UTC: User requested immediate visual monitoring UI (progress/bugs/token/VPS performance/alerts) faster than 3-day plan. Decision: deliver accelerated MVP \"Ops Cockpit\" now as standalone local web app. Scope delivered: realtime KPI cards, system chart (CPU/RAM/Disk), token today from session logs, blockers count + RAG distribution, owner activity chart, top processes table, recommendations panel, recent project updates feed from team logs. Evidence: service running on 0.0.0.0:18888 (python pid 31895), /health OK, /api/metrics returning live JSON. RAG: GREEN for MVP delivery, AMBER for production hardening (auth/HTTPS/persistence/service management pending). Owners: Mạnh AI (implementation), Huy AI (UI), Hà AI (metrics pipeline), Huyền AI (requirements conformance), PM (MINH AI) acceptance orchestration. ETA: MVP done now; hardening in next step (30–60 mins if approved). Blockers: none for local use; blocker for internet exposure unless auth + TLS added. Next: user UAT on dashboard, then decide hardening + integrate into gateway/control UI.\n- 06:53–06:54 UTC: User approved production hardening. Decision: completed hardening package for Ops Cockpit: (1) Basic Auth enforced for dashboard/API, (2) systemd service created/enabled (`ops-cockpit.service`) with auto-restart, (3) secret moved to `/etc/default/ops-cockpit`, (4) old nohup runtime replaced by managed service. Evidence: `systemctl status` = active (running) pid 32016; unauthenticated `/` returns 401 and authenticated returns 200; `/health` OK. RAG: GREEN for requested scope. Owners: Mạnh AI (implementation), Hà AI (service/runtime), Huy AI (UI continuity), PM validation by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: TLS/HTTPS not yet configured (internet traffic still HTTP). Next: optional step to add reverse proxy + TLS and rotate dashboard password after first login.\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776063623349}}
